  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tsp of ghee or oil in a pressure cooker over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and coriander seeds and let them sizzle for 1 minute.",
    "Add the roasted onion, ginger, and uradd dal and saut\t4 for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the lentils, turmeric powder, garam masala, and salt. Mix well.",
    "Add 4 cups of water to the pressure cooker and close the lid.",
    "Pressure cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Open the pressure cooker and stir in the orange blossom water and coconut milk.",
    "Add the chopped cilantro and mix well.",
    "Serve hot with rice or roti."
